    "The value state, attended adjoint, and independent source comparator retain their frozen byte counts and SHA-256 identities.",
    "BF16 inputs widen by exact upper-word placement, each reduction uses 128 ascending explicit hardware FMAs from positive zero, and the output rounds once to BF16 round-to-nearest-even.",
