    "No LibNC, GGML, CUDA, OpenMP, GOMP, BLAS, teacher execution, fitted correction, tolerance, or captured-output substitution participates in treatment execution.",
    "Both complete evaluations run as one-thread children in distinct empty cgroup-v2 domains under the decimal 10,000,000,000-byte memory cap.",
